{"final":{"answer":"The net change in Entergy Mississippi, Inc.'s net revenue during 2003 was an increase of $46.4 million (2003 net revenue of $426.6 million less 2002 net revenue of $380.2 million).","value":46.4,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t4c1n0","source:t2c1n0","source:t3c1n0"],"result_id":"tool:2","message":"2003 net revenue ($426.6 million) minus 2002 net revenue ($380.2 million) = $46.4 million increase. The table's components reconcile: 380.2 + 48.3 (base rates) - 1.9 (other) = 426.6."}}